# Security headers. Cloudflare Pages reads this file at deploy and attaches
# these to every response. The dev server ignores it, so check a deployed copy.
# Cloudflare already sends X-Content-Type-Options and Referrer-Policy.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security: only ever reach this site over HTTPS. Starting
#   at one day while it is new; raise to 31536000 (one year) once nothing
#   has broken.
# X-Frame-Options: no other site may show these pages inside a frame
#   (clickjacking). SAMEORIGIN still lets the site frame itself, which test
#   pages have used.
# Permissions-Policy: the site never uses these features, so nothing on it
#   can ask for them.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=86400; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
